{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ3MQ1L7X6sC1aYKCXad","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't find this figure with these tools. I did not get WBD's cumulative restructuring costs from the 2022 Merger as of December 31, 2024.\n\nThe number should be in the restructuring note of WBD's 10-K for fiscal 2024. I found that filing but couldn't read its contents:\n\n- **Ticker lookups failed.** The SEC tools don't list \"WBD\" (or the old \"DISCA\") as an active ticker, so I couldn't pull WBD's XBRL data.\n- **Full-text search only returns where a filing is.** It found the 10-K but doesn't show the text, so I couldn't read the restructuring footnote.\n- **The cross-company lookup failed.** SEC returned \"not found\" (404) for the cumulative restructuring-cost tag (`RestructuringAndRelatedCostCostIncurredToDate1`) for calendar 2024, so I couldn't find WBD's value that way.\n\nI've reached the tool-call budget. To get the number, open the 10-K below and look in the \"Restructuring and Other Charges\" note for the cumulative total since the Merger. The FY2024 annual report and the Q1 2025 10-Q should state the same figure.\n\n**Sources**\n- Form 10-K for FY2024, filed 2025-02-27, accession 0001437107-25-000031 (found but not readable here)\n- Form ARS, filed 2025-04-23, accession 0001308179-25-000479 (found but not readable here)\n- Form 10-Q for Q1 2025, filed 2025-05-08, accession 0001437107-25-000096 (found but not readable here)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":385,"cache_read_input_tokens":9903,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":385},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c725e4c5-ed60-42a1-